                <pb facs="0867" n="1917" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v11p2/pg1917"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952-1954. Africa and South Asia (in two parts):
                    Volume XI. Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d893-f3">Document 893, Page 1464,
                                Footnote 3</ref> (date of correction: May 08, 2013)</hi></item>
                    <item>Corrected name of the Deputy Secretary of Defense from John C. Foster to
                        William C. Foster.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
